  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Support for Persons Fleeing the Conflict in Ukraine Who Entered Greece on or after 24th February 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the Ukraine crisis, and as an active demonstration of solidarity to the populations affected by the ongoing hostilities, the project seeks to provide humanitarian assistance to crisis-affected populations arriving in Greece. Beneficiaries will have improved access to dignified and gender-appropriate support, as IOM, in coordination with the Greek authorities, are providing non-food items (NFIs) and equipment/furniture, tailored to the specific context and needs, as well as contribute to protection related efforts as requested by the national authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
